@Gateway.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242

### 1. Validar Conexión y Consumo con SuiteCRM REST Gateway
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/validate-connection
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Probar Login Directo a SuiteCRM
POST {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "login",
  "restData": {
    "user_auth": {
      "user_name": "admin",
      "password": "5aa1b8bbc427d07af4f3b440adaf1990",
      "version": "1"
      "version": "1"
    },
    "application_name": "VroomService Gateway",
    "name_value_list": []
  }
}

### 3. Validar y Consultar Datos del Módulo de Clientes (Contacts)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/modules/Contacts?maxResults=5

### 4. Validar y Consultar Datos del Módulo de Vehículos (vr_Vehiculos)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/modules/vr_Vehiculos?maxResults=5

### 5. Validar y Consultar Órdenes de Servicio (vr_Ordenes_Servicio)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/modules/vr_Ordenes_Servicio?maxResults=5

### 6. Validar y Consultar Centros de Servicio (vr_Centros_Servicio)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/modules/vr_Centros_Servicio?maxResults=5

### 7. Validar y Consultar Productos y Repuestos (AOS_Products)
GET {{Gateway.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/suitecrm/modules/AOS_Products?maxResults=5
